=== Generated Answer (model draft; check against evidence) ===
The model uses a Bidirectional Encoding architecture (Augenstein et al., 2016): it encodes the entity with a bidirectional LSTM (BiLSTM), which is then used to initialize a BiLSTM that encodes the article and produces a prediction [5]. To reduce the sequence length, they use the same context window that was presented to annotators for training the LSTM [5]. The model was trained on their collected dataset and is integrated into the 360° Stance Detection website as a web service [2].
